ox-center infobox-icons\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1486851632749871234/1487584538103123998/Openfront_UN_Olympics.png?ex=69c9ac8f&amp;is=69c85b0f&amp;hm=a82acf8aff7092476856a52f424cf4445b28c7580c561b506ccf49a714a6094a\"><i class=\"lp-icon lp-bracket\"></i></a></div></div></div><div class=\"fo-nttax-infobox-adbox\"></div><div></div></div><div class=\"fo-nttax-infobox-topcontent\"></div></div>\n<div data-analytics-name=\"Navigation tab\"><div class=\"tabs-static\" data-nosnippet=\"\" data-tabs-static=\"\"><div class=\"tabs-nav-wrapper\" data-tabs-nav-wrapper=\"\"><div class=\"tabs-scroll-arrow-wrapper tabs-scroll-arrow-wrapper--left\" data-tabs-arrow-left=\"\"><div class=\"btn btn-ghost tabs-scroll-arrow tabs-scroll-arrow--left\" title=\"Previous\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous\" tabindex=\"0\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex\"><svg class=\"liq-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M9.4 233.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3l192 192c12.5 12.5 32.8 12.5 45.3 0s12.5-32.8 0-45.3L77.3 256 246.6 86.6c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3s-32.8-12.5-45.3 0l-192 192z\"></path></svg></span></div></div><div class=\"tabs-scroll-arrow-wrapper tabs-scroll-arrow-wrapper--right\" data-tabs-arrow-right=\"\"><div class=\"btn btn-ghost tabs-scroll-arrow tabs-scroll-arrow--right\" title=\"Next\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next\" tabindex=\"0\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex\"><svg class=\"liq-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M311.1 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-192 192c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L243.2 256 73.9 86.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l192 192z\"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>UN Olympics</b> is an event hosted by the biggest clan in Openfront, United Nations. There were 3 events covered, 1v1s, FFA and Trios.\n</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"About\">About</h2></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Format\">Format</h3></div>\n<ul><li><b>General Information</b>\n<ul><li>Trios matchup</li>\n<li>Free registration</li>\n<li>5 games</li>\n<li>Average position taken across all games</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Map_Rotation\">Map Rotation</h4></div>\n<p>The following 5 maps were played in this exact rotation on each matchday:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Britannia</li>\n<li>Deglaciated Antartica</li>\n<li>Aegean</li>\n<li>East Asia</li>\n<li>Europe</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Final_Results\">Final Results</h3></div>\n<p>Scored by elimination position, or final placement at game end. Tiebreakers determined by games won.\n</p>\n<div class=\"prizepool-section-wrapper\"><span>$<abbr title=\"To Be Announced\">TBA</abbr>&nbsp;<abbr title=\"United States Dollar\">USD</abbr> are spread among the participants as seen below:<br></span><div class=\"prizepool-section-tables\"><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><details class=\"liq-collapse\"><summary>Prize pool</summary><div class=\"csstable-widget collapsed general-collapsible prizepooltable prizepooltable-placement\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(2, auto);width:max-content\"><div class=\"csstable-widget-row prizepooltable-header\" style=\"font-weight:bold\"><div class=\"csstable-widget-cell\" style=\"min-width:80px\">Place</div><div class=\"csstable-widget-cell prizepooltable-col-team\">Participant</div></div><div class=\"csstable-widget-row background-color-first-place\"><div class=\"csstable-widget-cell prizepooltable-place\" style=\"font-weight:bolder;grid-row:span 1\"><span title=\"First Place\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/images/liquipedia/Gold.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></span>&nbsp;1st</div><div class=\"csstable-widget-cell\" style=\"justify-content:start\"><div class=\"block-